+
+  - ds-bot/dev/desktop-linux/launch.mts follows the steps of
+    apps/desktop/scripts/dev.ts in DeepSeek Harness and reuses a few of its
+    lines (the release record and the Electron launch arguments). It is a
+    developer script for screenshots on Linux and is not in the npm package.
+  - app/src/host.mjs and app/src/profile.mjs follow
+    apps/desktop-host/src/index.ts: the profile boot and the ready, fatal and
+    shutdown messages. app/src/office-patch.mjs follows
+    apps/desktop-host/src/office.ts: the workspace-dependencies and skill-office
+    plugin rows with the payload's Node and the unpacked LibreOffice Kit CLI.
+  - ds-bot/src/office/skills/office/SKILL.md adapts the office routing skill
+    (assets/office/SKILL.md in @deepseek-ai/dsh-skill-office): the routing body
+    is kept, with one added row that routes package checks and in-place edits
+    to office-tools.
+  - app/scripts/prepare-runtime.mjs and app/scripts/primary-runtime.lock.json are a
+    JavaScript port of scripts/primary-runtime/ (prepare.ts, prune-python-tests.ts
+    and lock.json): the pinned Python, Node and wheel downloads with checksum
+    verification, the wheel test pruning and the Office skill asset copy.
+  - app/src/host-process.mjs follows apps/desktop/src/host-process.ts: the
+    Host in Electron's Node mode and the shutdown escalation.
+  - app/src/main.mjs and app/src/window-frame.mjs follow apps/desktop/src/main.ts
+    for the window options (the Windows caption-button overlay, its colors and
